<p>The exact solution can also be found using separation of variables. It is</p>
<p><m>y(x)=</m> <fillin characters="60" name="AnSwEr0011"/></p>
<p>Thus the actual value of the function at the point <m>x=1.1</m></p>
<p><m>y(1.1 ) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0012"/>.</p>
